PC1↔PC1 (overlap)"]]}},"alpha":{"FinFET":{"7/0":0.42,"11/0":0.86,"10/0":0.5},"CFET":{"7/0":0.3,"11/1":0.88,"11/2":0.88,"10/0":0.5},"QFET":{"7/0":0.34,"57/0":0.34,"11/1":0.88,"11/2":0.88,"511/1":0.88,"511/2":0.88,"10/0":0.5,"510/0":0.5,"700/0":0.3}},"migrations":{"finfet_to_cfet":{"from":"FinFET","to":"CFET","headline":"P/N 的分離從 Y 軸的兩條 row band，變成 Z 軸的兩個 tier","fold":{"note":["The migration reads as a fold: the PMOS row band rotates 180 degrees","about a line running along the cell's X direction, landing mirrored on","top of the NMOS band. The numbers below are exact, not decorative --","rotating FinFET's PMOS ACTIVE box y[79,125] about y=72 lands it at","y[19,65], which is precisely where the NMOS band sits.","","After the fold there is a second, smaller motion: each tier grows in Y","from a half-band (46 nm) to the full cell height (106 nm), because a","CFET tier no longer shares the cell height with the other device type.","That stretch is why CFET's P_ACTIVE and N_ACTIVE both span y[19,125]."],"axis":"x","at_y":72.0,"at_z":46.0,"moving_role":"P","source_role_rule":"a source box whose Y centre is above at_y carries the P device; below it, N"},"invariants":[{"what":"cell 寬度","value":"90 nm","why":"CPP 45 與 COL=2 兩邊相同"},{"what":"cell 高度","value":"144 nm","why":"同樣是 4-track、M0 pitch 24"},{"what":"CPP / M1P / OF","value":"45 / 30 / 0","why":"兩個 preset 的數值相同"},{"what":"BEOL 疊構","value":"M0 · M1 · M2 與 CA / V0 / V1","why":"遷移只動元件層，金屬層順序不變"},{"what":"gate 的 GDS 層號","value":"7/0","why":"CFET 的 gate stack 穿過兩個 tier，仍然只有一個圖層"}],"model":{"note":["Engine-level changes -- what the solver gains. Read from the layer JSON","and archit/*/tech.py, NOT from the GDS. Two of these three produce no","geometry at all, which is exactly why they need saying out loud: BPC is","a placement tier the solver reasons about, and BCA has no gds_layer, so","the writer emits its contacts onto CA's 14/0."],"placement_layers":{"from":["PC"],"to":["PC","BPC"]},"pin_access_layers":{"from":["M0"],"to":["BPC","M0"]},"lgg_z_order":{"from":["PC","M0","M1","M2"],"to":["BPC","PC","M0","M1","M2"]},"added":[{"name":"BPC","kind":"metal","layer_number":6,"draws_geometry":false,"note":"底層 placement tier。solver 會用它擺 NMOS，但 GDS writer 不會為它畫任何東西 —— gate 幾何全部落在 7/0。"},{"name":"BCA","kind":"via","lower":"BPC","upper":"M0","draws_geometry":false,"note":"layer JSON 裡沒有 gds_layer，writer 用跟 CA 同一支 __ca__() 畫在 14/0。所以 14/0 會混到兩種高度的接觸。"},{"name":"BPC↔M0","kind":"virtual_edge","method":"boundary","draws_geometry":false,"note":"寫死在 CFET/main.py 的 _init_graph，不是由 layer JSON 宣告（QFET 的 VL1 才是）。"}],"config_forced":[{"key":"lisd_routing","value":true,"note":"archit/config.py 看到 tech==\"CFET\" 就強制開啟；FinFET 預設 false。"},{"key":"lig_routing","value":true,"note":"同上。CFET 少了一層平面繞線資源，必須靠 MOL 補回來。"}]},"masks":[{"kind":"split_by_tier","from":{"key":"11/0","name":"ACTIVE"},"to":[{"key":"11/1","name":"P_ACTIVE","role":"P"},{"key":"11/2","name":"N_ACTIVE","role":"N"}],"note":"遷移的主角。FinFET 用兩個 y band 區分 P/N（y[79,125] 與 y[19,65]）；CFET 改用 datatype 區分 tier，兩層的 x/y 完全相同（都是 y[19,125]）。"},{"kind":"split_by_tier","from":{"key":"88/0","name":"SDT"},"to":[{"key":"88/1","name":"P_SDT","role":"P"},{"key":"88/2","name":"N_SDT","role":"N"}],"note":"source/drain trench 跟著它的 diffusion 走。"},{"kind":"split_by_tier","from":{"key":"17/0","name":"LISD"},"to":[{"key":"17/1","name":"P_LISD","role":"P"},{"key":"17/2","name":"N_LISD","role":"N"}],"note":"box 數量不會 1:1 對應 —— FinFET 在 P/N 共用同一個 S/D net 時會畫一根貫穿兩個 band 的 merged LISD，CFET 則是兩個 tier 各畫各的。"},{"kind":"reinterpreted","from":{"key":"7/0","name":"PC / GATE"},"to":[{"key":"7/0","name":"GATE (PC+BPC)","role":"shared"}],"note":"圖層號沒變，但意義變了：CFET 的 gate stack 實體上穿過上下兩顆元件，所以 writer 仍然只畫一個圖層，而立體圖裡它的 z 區間橫跨兩個 tier。"},{"kind":"reinterpreted","from":{"key":"14/0","name":"CA"},"to":[{"key":"14/0","name":"CA","role":"shared"}],"note":"同一個圖層，但 CFET 多承載了 BPC→M0 的接觸（BCA 沒有自己的 gds_layer）。內附的 INV_X1 沒有用到那條路徑，所以這顆 cell 的 14/0 仍然全是上層 tier 的接觸。"},{"kind":"unchanged","from":{"key":"1/0","name"